# Membership summary

Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-890b2176092d9ca77c601e96828688b964498b5b "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense [[cite:obs-07ceceb568a3b1fbd56d3b0d0967a9f559aff2dd "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
